{"game":"ModernUO","category":"death-respawn-penalty","cell":2,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Mobiles/BaseCreature.cs","licence":"GPL-3.0 (as read: LICENSE, GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3, 29 June 2007)","licence_class":"copyleft","target_module":"src/fight/death.ts","parity_row":17,"pattern_tags":["grace-timer","new:item-fate-tiers","new:cover-one-shot","new:damage-share-rights","new:corpse-criminal-loot","new:rolling-summon-cap"],"data_fields":[{"name":"loot_right_divisor_by_max_hp","donor_constant":"max HP >= 3000: top/16; >= 1000: top/8; >= 200: top/4; else top/2","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Mobiles/BaseCreature.cs:3440"},{"name":"first_damager_bonus","donor_constant":"x 1.25 (integer cast)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Mobiles/BaseCreature.cs:3428"},{"name":"murderer_kill_count","donor_constant":"Kills >= 5","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/Server/Mobiles/Mobile.cs:1677"},{"name":"insurance_cost_per_item","donor_constant":"600 gold flat; halved when a player was the reward target","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Engines/Insurance/Insurance.cs:22"},{"name":"insurance_reward_per_saved_item","donor_constant":"300 gold","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Engines/Insurance/Insurance.cs:115"},{"name":"corpse_decay_s","donor_constant":"7 min (420 s)","unit":"s","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Items/Misc/Corpses/Corpse.cs:96"},{"name":"corpse_instanced_window_s","donor_constant":"3 min (180 s)","unit":"s","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Items/Misc/Corpses/Corpse.cs:94"},{"name":"undead_cap_per_caster","donor_constant":"3 (the fourth kills the oldest)","unit":"count","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:272"},{"name":"undead_rot_interval_ms","donor_constant":"1650 ms, 1 hit point per tick","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:280"},{"name":"undead_life_s","donor_constant":"1 day (86400 s)","unit":"s","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:366"},{"name":"animate_fame_gate","donor_constant":"owner fame >= 100","unit":"count","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:140"},{"name":"animate_ability_scale","donor_constant":"(necro x 30 + spirit x 70) / 10 x 18, clamped to owner fame","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:317"},{"name":"skeletal_dragon_scale","donor_constant":"50 (percent hp and strength)","unit":"ratio","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/ModernUO/Projects/UOContent/Spells/Necromancy/AnimateDeadSpell.cs:371"}],"best_idea":"Loot rights come from each player's damage share on the fight, with the threshold a fraction of the top share that shrinks as the boss's max HP grows, and the first hitter gets a bonus, so a finisher and a small hitter are both data-driven.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The damage-share rights and the max-HP divisor fit Frankendom's many-on-one fights (MAX_ATTACKERS = 3) and the one-ledger rule; the item fate tiers (blessed, newbied, murderer, young) are the shape for the open PvP flag. Insurance as a paid cover is not adopted, the donor's flat 600 cost does not scale with item value, and the undead rot timer is not copied (it never stops).","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test on a 3000-max-HP target with three players: the top attacker's total is multiplied by 1.25 for the first hit, a player below top/16 gets no loot right, and a player at or above it gets the right; the same test for a murderer shows newbied items are lost while a non-murderer keeps them."}
